system-settings/
│
├── index.blade.php
│   Main page
│   Load all setting sections
│
├── form.blade.php
│   Main <form>
│   Save button
│
└── partials/
    │
    ├── _general.blade.php
    │   - System name
    │   - System logo
    │   - Favicon
    │
    ├── _mail.blade.php
    │   - Mail driver
    │   - SMTP host
    │   - Port
    │   - Username
    │   - Password
    │
    ├── _security.blade.php
    │   - Password length
    │   - Login attempts
    │   - Session timeout
    │
    └── _theme.blade.php
        - Primary color
        - Secondary color
        - Sidebar style
        - Default language